  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One United Nation- Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">One United Nation- Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A program proposal (July 2017) has been submitted to Sweden&apos;s Embassy in Bolivia through the Resident Coordinator&apos;s Office in Bolivia entitled &quot;COORDINATED GENDER STRATEGY ONE-UN IN BOLIVIA 2017-2020.&quot; The project proposes a UN Joint Action, for enhanced coordination with 5 UN organizations: UNFPA, UNICEF, UN Women, UNODC, UNDP and the co-ordinating Office of the Resident Coordinator (ORC) in Bolivia. The aim is to &quot;promote gender equality in Bolivia under UNDAF-Bolivia strategy&quot;. The project is part of the implementation of UNDAF Bolivia&apos;s main program and further intends to secure commitment and ownership among UN organizations operating in Bolivia, as well as establishing a common framework for follow-up, learning and evaluation. The overall budget is in support of coordination and coordination. The program both means strengthening the results for gender equality per se as a methodology of strengthening coordination in ONE UN spirit without requiring co-programming. The program is  for the period  (2017-2020). The total amount sought for the project amounts to 3MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett programf&#xf6;rslag (juli 2017) har inkommit till Sveriges ambassad i Bolivia genom Resident Coordinators kontor i Bolivia med titeln &#x201d;COORDINATED GENDER STRATEGY ONE- UN IN BOLIVIA 2017-2020&quot;. Projektet f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;r en gemensam FN-insats, f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad samordning tillsammans med 5 FN organisationer: UNFPA, UNICEF, UN Women, UNODC, UNDP  samt den samordnande ORC (Office of the Resident Coordinator) i Bolivia. Syftet &#xe4;r att &quot;fr&#xe4;mja j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;llhet i Bolivia inom ramen for UNDAF-Bolivia strategi&#x201d;. Projektet ing&#xe5;r i genomf&#xf6;randet av UNDAF Bolivias huvudprogram och avser vidare att s&#xe4;kra engagemang och &#xe4;garskap bland FN-organisationer verksamma i Bolivia, samt att etablera ett gemensamt ramverk f&#xf6;r uppf&#xf6;ljning, l&#xe4;rande och utv&#xe4;rdering. Den totala budgeten g&#xe5;r till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r koordinering och samordningen. Programmet inneb&#xe4;r b&#xe5;de ett st&#xe4;rkande av resultaten f&#xf6;r j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet per se som en metodutveckling vad g&#xe4;ller st&#xe4;rkt samordning i ONE UN anda utan att kr&#xe4;va samprogrammering. Programmet &#xe4;r fyra&#xe5;rigt (2017-2020). Det totala s&#xf6;kta beloppet f&#xf6;r projektet uppg&#xe5;r till 3MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase  the efficiency and sustainability of the actions implemented by the different agencies in the country for gender equality and the exercise of the rights of women, children and adolescents, which are articulated in the UNDAF 2018-2022.</narrative>
  </description>
